            "verseId": "ROM.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then as one man's trespass led to condemnation for all men, so one man's act of righteousness leads to acquittal and life for all men. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PHP.2.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Phil 2.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " For as by one man's disobedience many were made sinners, so by one man's obedience many will be made righteous. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
